ield/key "$det(R)=\\frac{4}{5} - \\sqrt{2}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529248}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "2eb19151-d434-5c12-a703-9c37eed13782" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true regarding the matrix $R$ given below?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n$$\nR=\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & \\frac{2}{5} & - \\sqrt{2} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & \\frac{4}{5} & \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ - \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{4} & \\frac{2}{5} & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Remember that a square matrix is singular if its determinant is equal to $0.$\n\nUsing the formula, we take the alternating sum of the entries in the top row of the matrix, multiplied by their respective minors, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(R) & =|\\begin{aligned}- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & \\frac{2}{5} & - \\sqrt{2} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & \\frac{4}{5} & \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ - \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{4} & \\frac{2}{5} & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4}{5} & \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ \\frac{2}{5} & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}|+(- \\frac{2}{5})|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ - \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{4} & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}|+(- \\sqrt{2})|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & \\frac{4}{5} \\\\ - \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{4} & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})(- \\frac{2 \\sqrt{2}}{5}- \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{5})+(- \\frac{2}{5})(- \\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{9}{4})+(- \\sqrt{2})(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{5}+\\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{5}) \\\\  & =(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})\\cdot (- \\sqrt{2})+(- \\frac{2}{5})\\cdot \\frac{7}{4}+(- \\sqrt{2})\\cdot \\frac{4 \\sqrt{2}}{5} \\\\  & =1- \\frac{7}{10}- \\frac{8}{5} \\\\  & =- \\frac{13}{10}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $det(R)=- \\frac{13}{10}\\ne 0$, the matrix is **not** singular. \n\nTherefore, only statement “$R$ is **not** a singular matrix” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186529220 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4f10ee21-6b89-5e0f-a04a-e49bcfa4c907" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529218} {:answer/id #uuid "fe16b8a0-13d3-5554-8edd-ff60470da1a2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529255}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fe16b8a0-13d3-5554-8edd-ff60470da1a2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529255} :answer-field/id #uuid "283cd5ed-404d-513a-8b29-74966f63a5de" :answer-field/key "$D$ is **not** a singular matrix" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529213} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9bbf7977-41f6-5bb2-bc84-9b91b4aa2e00" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529239} {:answer/id #uuid "b655c0ce-1985-5548-8848-5fb9f83b43c3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529242}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9bbf7977-41f6-5bb2-bc84-9b91b4aa2e00" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529239} :answer-field/id #uuid "57424796-2385-5961-a89c-2d74ee068fcd" :answer-field/key "$det(D)=0$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186529219} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "670467a6-e81c-5c99-be97-28f089cc9d37" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident